    {
      "id": "u_ff32f4ba95db35fa242e2681_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Alternatively if you want to serve the instance under a different path (useful e.g. if you want to serve multiple instances), update the location block like so:",
      "sourceHash": "ff32f4ba95db35fa242e2681fa2d71f5ffd9abd0035693daf8773c158aab4abf",
      "context": "Nginx > Serving under a different path",
      "contextHash": "0c59443b06b4642c81dd3c01e625f7b944565ce7d8a00998783bef935f629f67",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "あるいは、別のパスでインスタンスを公開したい場合（複数のインスタンスを公開する場合などに便利です）、locationブロックを次のように更新します：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7fbc09ee5088bb77fdd3abc5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "update the location with your desired path (make sure to not leave a trailing slash \"/\", if your __TRILIUM_PH_0__ does not end on a slash as well)",
      "sourceHash": "7fbc09ee5088bb77fdd3abc505ff0a0574fafb713d2a1952c5c395a4c8fda3fc",
      "context": "Nginx > Serving under a different path",
      "contextHash": "0c59443b06b4642c81dd3c01e625f7b944565ce7d8a00998783bef935f629f67",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__がスラッシュで終わっていない場合は、末尾にスラッシュ「/」を残さないように注意しながら、locationをご希望のパスに更新してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
